**Report Format:** §1.3 Technology

== Fields ==

|=Field|=Description
|ID|TECH-08
|Name|Audio recording (rejected)
|Status|In Progress
|Evidence basis|Group reasoning.
|Category|Sensing
|Capabilities|Recordings for tuning speech recognition and for coding research sessions.
|Limitations|A store of private conversations and secrets.
|Maturity and feasibility|High.
|Failure and fallback behaviour|Not applicable - rejected.
|Benefits|No Human Value; research only: re-coding and reliability checks after the fact.
|Drawbacks|Violates HV-03. Observers code live instead (EM-02).
